---
# Apple/LLVM-inspired formatting: based on the LLVM style with Swift
# ergonomics (4-space indent, 100 columns, lowercase members, `.h` headers).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
AccessModifierOffset: -4
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Right
DerivePointerAlignment: false
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
Standard: c++20
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: InlineOnly